graph TD
    accTitle: Symbols linked to a paragraph
    accDescr: A file contains headings that contain a paragraph. A trigram, a bigram and a unigram symbol each link to that paragraph with a contains edge, weighted 9, 4 and 1 by default.
    Root["file@root<br>(Ask-Microsoft-<br>transparency-FAQ.pdf)"]
    H1["heading:1<br>(Ask Microsoft: Responsible AI FAQ)"]
    H2["heading:2<br>(What are the limitations...?)"]
    P5["paragraph:5<br>(The chatbot uses AI...)"]
    
    SymTri["symbol::trigram<br>(limitation_ask_microsoft)"]
    SymBi["symbol::bigram<br>(ask_microsoft)"]
    SymUni["symbol::unigram<br>(limitation)"]

    Root -->|part_of| H1
    H1 -->|part_of| H2
    H2 -->|part_of| P5

    SymTri -->|"contains (trigram, x9)"| P5
    SymBi -->|"contains (bigram, x4)"| P5
    SymUni -->|"contains (unigram, x1)"| P5
